  "prefLabel": "Pod 401.02 Renewal of License",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pod 401.02 Renewal of License.\n\n(a) At least 2 months prior to the expiration date of a license issued under this chapter, the office of professional licensure and certification (OPLC) shall provide to each licensee a notice of the need to complete their renewal application.\n\n(b) Any licensee wishing to renew a license shall submit:\n\n(1) The completed renewal application described in Pod 401.03 below;\n\n(2) The fee as specified in Plc 1002.40; and\n\n(3) Proof of completion of the continuing education requirements of Pod 402.\n\nSource. #5391, eff 5-8-92, EXPIRED: 5-8-98\n\nNew. #8061, eff 3-12-04; ss by #9901-A, eff 4-15-11, EXPIRED: 4-15-19\n\nNew. #12811, INTERIM, eff 6-14-19, EXPIRED: 12-11-19\n\nNew. #13819, eff 2-9-24; ss by #14457, eff 2-8-26, EXPIRES: 2-8-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pod100-500.html"
